mn-tui (arc-mn-tui)
Copyright 2026 Input Output Global, Inc.
Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0

The TUI component of Moth draws on architectural patterns, screen layouts,
and wallet integration approaches from mn-tui, a terminal wallet manager
for the Midnight Network developed by Input Output Global with AI assistance.
Specifically, the following design elements were informed by mn-tui:

- Screen-based navigation (Dashboard, Send, Deploy, Mint, Contract State,
  Keys, DUST/Designate, Network Config, Logs)
- React/Ink component architecture for terminal rendering
- Wallet sync engine pattern (useWalletSync hook architecture)
- Chain polling pattern (useMidnightNode hook architecture)
- DUST monitoring component design
- Balance table formatting
- Transaction status display patterns
- SDK workaround patterns (WebSocket polyfill, transaction intent signing,
  three-wallet sync heuristic, cache eviction on genesis reset)

Source: https://github.com/input-output-hk/arc-mn-tui
License: Apache-2.0

