midnight-wallet-cli
Copyright 2026 Norman Lopez (nel349)
Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0

Portions of Moth's TUI and sync components are ported from or mirror
midnight-wallet-cli, a standalone CLI wallet for the Midnight Network.
Specifically:

- DUST registration multi-step flow (tui/screens/dust.tsx)
- Per-wallet sync progress formatting and the per-sub-wallet
  applied/total progress shape (tui/utils/sync.ts, core/sync/wallet-sync.ts)
- Balance and display formatting style (tui/utils/display.ts,
  tui/utils/balance.ts)
- Section heading pattern (tui/components/SectionHeader.tsx)
- Screen navigation types (tui/navigation/types.ts)
- Dashboard state view patterns (tui/screens/dashboard/)
- Network endpoint values (core/types/network.ts, mirroring
  midnight-wallet-cli/src/config/environments.ts)

Moth's localnet funding flow and daemon integration tests also invoke
the midnight-wallet-cli npm package directly (midnight airdrop).

Source: https://github.com/nel349/midnight-wallet-cli
License: Apache-2.0

